    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Late-Night Ramen</i></strong> is a cozy, isometric, section-of-the-screen cooking sim where you run a small ramen house after dark. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862940/extras/682736bb3a004d0722c654d20effa6fa.poster.avif?t=1752041769\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862940/extras/682736bb3a004d0722c654d20effa6fa.apng?t=1752041769\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=314 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills as a chef, unlock new recipes, and serve steaming bowls of comfort to nighttime customers \u2014 all in a peaceful, blue hour atmosphere perfect for unwinding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862940/extras/a810ef36aa9ed0471d53a41686c0787a.poster.avif?t=1752041769\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862940/extras/a810ef36aa9ed0471d53a41686c0787a.apng?t=1752041769\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=300 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0</p>",
